## Notes

- Free tier provides 100K API credits per day
- Each transaction summary call costs ~10 credits
- LLM-based summaries may take 2-5 seconds to generate
- Pre-LLM algorithmic classification is faster but less detailed
- For production use, consider getting a Blockscout Pro API key

